window.docContents[184].resolve({"/part-1-foundations/ch02-03-ultrapower/#Lectures-on-the-Hyperreals-___-Interactive-Lean-4-___-Spatial-Edition--Part-I-___-Foundations-of-the-Hyperreal-Line--Chapters-2-___-3___-Large-Sets___-Ultrafilters-___-the-Ultrapower--_LT_missing_GT_--From-Fr___chet___s-Cofinite-Filter-to-a-Free-Ultrafilter":{"contents":"In Ch02_LargeSets.lean and Ch03_UltrapowerConstruction.lean, we formalize Goldblatt's filter hierarchy:\n\n1. Cofinite (Fréchet) filter: A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N} is cofinite iff A^c is finite. Cofinite sets are closed under finite intersections and supersets, and exclude all finite sets so finite-index accidents are ignored.2. Finite Intersection Property & Zorn's Lemma: Any family with the FIP generates a proper filter, and Zorn's Lemma extends the cofinite filter to a maximal proper filter—a free (nonprincipal) ultrafilter \\mathcal{F} satisfying A \\in \\mathcal{F} \\iff A^c \\notin \\mathcal{F} for every A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}.3. Ultrapower Quotient: Identifying two sequences r \\sim s iff \\{n \\in \\mathbb{N} : r_n = s_n\\} \\in \\mathcal{F} produces the hyperreal ordered field \\mathbb{R}^* (aligned seamlessly with Mathlib's Hyperreal := Germ (hyperfilter ℕ : Filter ℕ) ℝ).\n\n\n\nsection\nopen Goldblatt\n\n-- Raw sequence rings have zero divisors (1,0,1,0,...) * (0,1,0,1,...) = 0:\n#check seqEvenOne_mul_seqOddOne\n#check seq_has_zero_divisors\n\n-- Modulo any filter F, index-wise agreement is an equivalence congruence:\n#check seqEquiv_equivalence\n#check seqEquiv_add_mul\nend\n\n\n","context":"Lectures on the Hyperreals — Interactive Lean 4 & Spatial Edition\u0009Part I — Foundations of the Hyperreal Line\u0009Chapters 2 & 3: Large Sets, Ultrafilters & the Ultrapower  <missing>","header":"1.2.1. From Fréchet's Cofinite Filter to a Free Ultrafilter","id":"/part-1-foundations/ch02-03-ultrapower/#Lectures-on-the-Hyperreals-___-Interactive-Lean-4-___-Spatial-Edition--Part-I-___-Foundations-of-the-Hyperreal-Line--Chapters-2-___-3___-Large-Sets___-Ultrafilters-___-the-Ultrapower--_LT_missing_GT_--From-Fr___chet___s-Cofinite-Filter-to-a-Free-Ultrafilter"}});